OL,3,GNEWSACumbrian band behind star-studded
OL,4,AUkraine aid gig
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Cumbrian band who were the first
OL,7,FBritish outfit to tour war-torn Ukraine
OL,8,Fis behind a star-studded gig in aid of
OL,9,Fwomen and children impacted by the
OL,10,Fconflict.
OL,12,FHardwicke Circus have toured twice
OL,13,Facross music venues, hospitals and
OL,14,Fprosthetic centres in Ukraine since the
OL,15,Fwar's outbreak.
OL,17,FThey are behind Songs Of Freedom, a gig
OL,18,Ffeaturing Bob Geldof, Madness and Peter
OL,19,FHook, to be held at Manchester's Co-Op
OL,20,FLive on 3 February and streamed
OL,21,Fworldwide.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
