OL,3,GNEWSACumbrian band behind star-studded
OL,4,AUkraine aid gig
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Paul McCartney, Barbra Streisand
OL,7,Fand Sean Penn will appear via video
OL,8,Flink at the event. It will be promoted
OL,9,Fby Harvey Goldsmith, who promoted Live
OL,10,FAid in 1985, organised by Geldof and
OL,11,FMidge Ure to raise money for famine
OL,12,Frelief efforts in Ethiopia.
